From 3b5f359ff2eca8cb36ee2d753772d84e8a4fcdb4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 15:46:26 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(project): step the file to v77 for stored tool
 reservations

Address the second review of PR #3284:
- Step PROJECT_VERSION to 77. A stored machine can hold reserved_tools,
  so an older reader must refuse the file. A v76 file steps up unchanged.
  Rule entries in project/file.rs and project/apply.rs.
- Remove the T99 probe reservation from the 18 Tormach machine files.
  No public Tormach document that names T99 was cited.
